WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.916
Welcome to Lee's Detective Agency.

00:00:02.916 --> 00:00:04.875
 We accept every manner of requests 

00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:05.875
and will do our best to meet your needs 

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:06.791
in goods delivery, pick up,

00:00:06.791 --> 00:00:07.791
infiltration, investigation, 

00:00:07.791 --> 00:00:11.041
arbitration, and conflict resolution.

00:00:11.041 --> 00:00:14.875
We can solve *anything* in Lungmen

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:19.500
except for detective work because that's police business... 

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.375
please don't expect this to be a detective show.

00:02:02.791 --> 00:02:07.125
A Day of Perfection

00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:36.666
Uncle Tung?

00:02:38.166 --> 00:02:38.875
Waai Fu.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.250
Did Jaye swing by your place?

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:41.375
No.

00:02:42.375 --> 00:02:43.625
What's going on?

00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:44.916
Well.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.416
I'm warning you again. Not with your hands. You'll get hurt.

00:02:57.791 --> 00:03:00.000
I need 5 pounds of fins and 5 pounds of shrimps.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.375
The juicier, the better.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:17.875
Hey!

00:03:22.166 --> 00:03:24.500
And that was how Jaye was taken away.

00:03:26.375 --> 00:03:28.000
A group of people in suits?

00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:31.000
Do they look like this?

00:03:32.041 --> 00:03:32.666
Well.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.000
Yeah. They do look like this.

00:03:46.875 --> 00:03:49.166
Did Jaye mention where he was going?

00:03:53.625 --> 00:03:55.625
No.

00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:08.916
Jaye here.

00:04:09.125 --> 00:04:10.791
Can't pick up the phone right now.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.541
Leave your message after the beep.

00:04:16.041 --> 00:04:17.375
This smells like the Cats.

00:04:18.041 --> 00:04:20.791
I got this. Go home, Uncle Tung. And lock your doors and windows.

00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:22.791
You know where he is?

00:04:23.375 --> 00:04:24.875
I'll look around the theater.

00:04:37.791 --> 00:04:38.875
Hi.

00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:42.625
I knew the Cat Mafia won't give up like this!

00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:43.166
Despicable.

00:04:43.166 --> 00:04:45.041
How dare they seek revenge on simpletons!

00:04:45.041 --> 00:04:45.916
Don't rush into things.

00:04:45.916 --> 00:04:47.250
Are you really sure it's the Cat Mafia?

00:04:48.375 --> 00:04:50.875
They're right in front of us.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.250
We've been watching them for the entire day.

00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:55.875
Nobody came out of the place.

00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:01.541
Huh? Then who's the culprit?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:26.791
Jaye!

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.041
Place is booked for a private show. Invited guests only.

00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:38.250
Meow.

00:05:39.791 --> 00:05:41.125
Do you really expect that to work?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:51.625
Situation normal.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:52.666
Roger.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:53.916
Situation looks normal here as well.

00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:13.625
Who asked you to come here?

00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:17.000
Fate.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.375
The injustice of fate called me here.

00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:23.416
The sound effects are too realistic!

00:06:24.791 --> 00:06:26.375
Then why are you here?

00:06:26.375 --> 00:06:29.666
I'm here to take back what belongs to me.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.125
Get out of here!

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:33.625
I refuse!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:46.666
Waai Fu.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.250
Found him!

00:06:54.791 --> 00:06:55.416
We got a situation.

00:07:10.291 --> 00:07:11.291
Stop right there!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.166
Sorry.

00:07:24.625 --> 00:07:25.875
I need to explain what's going on.

00:07:26.625 --> 00:07:27.291
About that ruckus,

00:07:27.291 --> 00:07:28.666
that girl is actually my friend.

00:07:41.666 --> 00:07:42.625
What the?

00:07:46.416 --> 00:07:47.875
Are you alright?

00:08:00.375 --> 00:08:01.625
Are you alright?

00:08:02.791 --> 00:08:03.750
You made a mistake.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.041
I was watching a play with them.

00:08:06.041 --> 00:08:08.166
I have to tell Lady Zhu that I need to go.

00:08:09.791 --> 00:08:12.541
What do you mean? I thought you were kidnapped.

00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:15.291
No. This is my job.

00:08:21.416 --> 00:08:22.375
His job?

00:08:24.625 --> 00:08:26.291
What a weird old man.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:31.250
He pays people just to watch plays with his little girl.

00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:40.541
As the heiress of Hatton Hotels, is there anything that troubles you?

00:08:40.875 --> 00:08:42.000
I actually

00:08:42.875 --> 00:08:44.666
wish to make a few friends.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.750
We can watch plays and chat together.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:49.416
That's right.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.250
Really?

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:52.916
I didn't expect that.

00:08:53.416 --> 00:08:55.916
She wants friends?

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.625
Things that money can buy won't last.

00:09:00.791 --> 00:09:02.416
And why do you need that much money anyway?

00:09:04.791 --> 00:09:06.000
I want to buy a house.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:09.875
You'll never afford one if you keep working with me.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.125
I know.

00:09:12.875 --> 00:09:14.625
So when will you leave me everything you own?

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.708
*LUNGMEN EXPLETIVE*

00:09:50.208 --> 00:09:52.333
Please find Jaye and bring him back.

00:09:52.333 --> 00:09:54.958
Jaye was taken away from the fish stand by mysterious people in suits this morning

00:09:54.958 --> 00:09:55.833
and is not seen again thereafter.

00:09:55.833 --> 00:09:57.458
Having failed to find him, Uncle Tung

00:09:57.458 --> 00:09:58.875
came to Lee's D.A to file a missing person report.

00:09:58.875 --> 00:10:01.625
After being shown the photos of Cat Mafiosi, Uncle Tung

00:10:01.625 --> 00:10:03.333
suspected that Jaye was taken by the said organization.

00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:05.208
The situation is urgent and calls for immediate action!

